<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n29385" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">mŏdĭŏlus</span></b> ,
		i, m.
		dim.
		modius, lit., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a small measure;</i> hence, transf., </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>A kind of drinking-vessel</i>, <i><span class="en">Dig. 34,
				2, 37</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>A bucket</i> on a water-wheel, <i><span class="en">Vitr. 10,
			9</span></i>: modioli gemelli, <i>the boxes</i> or <i>cylinders</i> of a forcing-pump, <i><span class="en">id. 10,
			13</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>III.</b>
			<i>The nave</i> of a wheel, <i><span class="en">Plin. 9, 4, 3,
				§ 8</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Vitr. 10,
			4</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>IV.</b>
			<i>The box</i> to receive the axle-tree of an oilmill,
					<i><span class="en">Cato, R. R.
			20</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>V.</b> A
			surgical instrument, <i>a cylindrical borer with a
				serrated edge, a trepan</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χοινίκιον</span>, <i><span class="en">Cels. 8, 3 <i>init.</i></span></i></div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
